{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SuperShot 是一款 iPhone 及 iPad 的截圖編輯工具，可拼接長圖、標註重點、辨識與翻譯圖中文字，並在分享前遮蓋個人資料，適合經常整理對話紀錄、收集網頁參考或講解操作流程的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>長截圖拼接與重點標註</h2>\n<p>SuperShot 支援垂直或水平拼接截圖，自動偵測重疊位置，也可把螢幕錄影的選取範圍轉成長圖。標註工具包含箭頭、文字、形狀、螢光標示與步驟編號，並可放大細節或聚焦重點。智能私隱檢查會找出疑似敏感文字與條碼，人臉可套用模糊或實色遮罩。文字辨識支援複製、分享與翻譯，表格可匯出成 CSV 或 TSV。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-379-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-380-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-381-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-382-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-383-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-384-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SuperShot – Screenshot Editor</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T06:18:40.055287+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}